    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "The coupling gate resolves a deleted path's owners from the head index, where the claim the same change withdrew no longer exists, so a correct removal is refused as C-001 against a package floor that has nothing to say about it. A path the change deletes is judged against the base snapshot of the diff the gate already reads, which is the merge base and not the supplied base ref.\n",
